apple-itunes:1662639047.description:
My Finances: a complete personal finance manager.
Minhas Finanças combines comprehensive money management and artificial intelligence to help you organize, understand, and improve your financial life.
Key features:
• Mia, your AI financial assistant for questions, analysis, and personalized recommendations;
• AI-powered reports to identify trends, opportunities, and areas that need attention;
• Record income, expenses, and transfers using natural language;
• Scan receipts and payment confirmations to create transactions faster;
• Manage income, expenses, and transfers;
• Track installment, recurring, and variable transactions;
• Complete credit card management;
• Monitor your monthly savings;
• Create budgets for categories, subcategories, tags, and credit cards;
• Set and track financial goals;
• Manage investments;
• Advanced reports with custom filters;
• Charts and statistics to follow your financial progress;
• Categories, subcategories, and tags to organize transactions;
• Export data to Excel, PDF, and CSV;
• Attach receipts and documents;
• Transfer money between accounts;
• Create additional profiles to manage separate finances in the same app;
• Support for multiple currencies and custom exchange rates between profiles;
• Password and Face ID protection;
• Sync across devices and platforms with the Sync plan.
Some features require a subscription or one-time purchase. Check the Plans and Pricing menu for details.
